===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# ''[[Manilkara zapota]]'', a long-lived [[evergreen]] [[tree]] native to the New World tropics.
# The [[fruit]] from the sapodilla tree. It is 4-8 cm in diameter and has fuzzy brown skin with earthy brown flesh.

